WEBVTT

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.980
A member who doesn't do anything.

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.240
She really pisses me off.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.860
I only became the president's aide
because I wouldn't have to do any work.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.540
It's not like I wanted to...

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:27.610
Hey, Maki.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:28.940
Riko.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:34.360
With Mizushima-senpai after us,
we can't let our guard down.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.960
Your intelligence is down, though.

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:41.400
Riko, did Mizushima-senpai say
something to you yesterday?

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.850
She didn't say anything.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.900
Huh? Her eyes are red.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.320
Was she working late again last night?

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:53.400
A vice president who does everything.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.530
Oh, shut up already!

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:01.290
N-No, not you!

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.540
Sorry.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.540
I'm taking today off from student council.

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:06.460
What? Why?

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:07.840
It's no big deal.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:12.730
Besides, we can't practice romance
until Mizushima-senpai gives up,

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:14.590
so there's no reason for me to be there.

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:15.840
Riko.

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:19.600
Hey...

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:20.720
Wait!

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.240
Let go of me!

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:27.270
Ah, Senpa—

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:05.480
Sayo and Eno Declare War

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.410
What's wrong with you?

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:05.920
I...

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.620
I want to do it, too!

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:13.340
We were doing it every
day, so now I'm lonely.

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:15.290
It's making me so frustrated.

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.380
C-Calm down!

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.880
Calm down and state the subject!

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:21.630
That's why I'm going to do it here!

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.500
Y-You've got the wrong idea!

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.170
She's talking about marathons!

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:31.350
Why did you have to go and declare
war without consulting me first?

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:34.560
I got caught up in the
talk about Baron Hug-Hug.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:37.360
What kind of reason is that? And who's he?

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:41.360
But they realized I'd been
the one harassing them.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.260
What? Really?

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:47.580
So my name must have come up too, then...

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.780
No, not at all.

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:51.020
It couldn't have been "not at all!"

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.920
Okay, no one touched on the subject.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.380
That's even worse!

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.380
You weren't even considered?

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.790
Enough!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.770
Damn that Maki.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:03.240
Just how long does she have to ignore me?

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.130
Why are we doing this?

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:11.520
That's what I'd like to know.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:13.820
I'll make sure she can't ignore me.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.980
Where were you keeping that?

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.360
Maki Natsuo!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:22.570
Your dad is lingerie!

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:25.280
What just happened?

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:29.740
Bringing my parents into this is absurd!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.580
Sorry, but could you tell
me more about your dad?

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:38.260
The back lighting makes
it hard to see her face.

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:40.670
Who are you, you coward?!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.350
You still don't know?

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.640
Just how far beneath your notice am I?

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:50.100
Even his daughter is lingerie!

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:52.850
Seriously, why are you doing that?

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.550
It's working.

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:56.910
Sayo, you say something, too.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:58.560
Okay, then...

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:02.030
Your older brother's a sponge!

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:04.970
I don't have an older brother.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:06.780
I have a younger brother.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:08.990
My older brother works.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.230
You're wrong!

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.830
My brother's searching for himself right now!

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:17.190
I just blurted out something random.
I didn't mean your family.

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:18.350
Really?

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:19.680
Good, then.

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:20.760
Let's go!

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:21.460
Where?

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:23.430
What did she mean by "lingerie"?

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:25.670
N-No comment...

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.560
Is your dad retro sexy?

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:30.480
Lingerie has an adult sound
to it, don't you think?

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:33.890
I can't hear you!

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:37.730
We'll investigate the student council
room while they're out there.

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:41.620
You know, I think what he should
be looking for is a job, not himself.

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.800
You <i>were</i> talking about my family!

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.270
Just speaking in general.

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:47.430
I'm not talking about your family.

00:05:48.470 --> 00:05:50.440
Faculty Office

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:50.450
The key to the student council room?

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:55.370
But, Maki-san insisted that I not give it
to anyone who isn't a current member.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:59.460
Sensei, you don't recognize me
as the student council president,

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.320
much less a member?

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:02.550
Y-You can have it.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.160
Just don't cry.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.600
Well? That was some
impressive acting, wasn't it?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.490
Yeah, it was amazing.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.260
So stop crying already.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.790
Wh-What is that?

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.460
Baron Hug-Hug.

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:26.880
Please knock!!

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:33.670
I think Maki kept the important
documents in this cabinet.

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:38.410
Huh?

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:40.170
What is this file?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:41.500
There's nothing written on—

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.910
Love Lab Results

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:49.410
The Next Day

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:54.720
Heading to the student council?

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:56.370
Yeah, I guess.

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.240
It's such a pain.

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:00.960
You say that, but I know you enjoy it.

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:01.520
Huh?

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:04.270
You used to look so bored all the time,

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:07.280
but you haven't looked like that
since you became a member.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:11.360
I had no idea you liked work so much.

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:18.580
Work, huh?

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:23.140
She's right. I'm not bored anymore.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:25.840
She forced me to become her aide,

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.840
but if I really don't like it,
I don't have to go.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:33.640
Maki.

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:44.810
M-Maki!

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:47.650
President Maki!

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:51.280
She's overworked and hasn't slept enough.

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:54.780
The student council at
this school is quite busy.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:58.250
She's the type to feel obligated
to handle everything herself,

00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.660
so try to keep an eye on her.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.360
You're her aide, aren't you?

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:04.480
I knew.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:08.090
I knew Maki had been pushing
herself too hard lately.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:12.020
I knew, but I didn't do anything about it.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.510
Kurahashi-senpai?

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.430
I finally found some solid evidence.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:23.980
They've been practicing techniques
to catch boys' attention

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.350
and have wonderful encounters.

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:28.110
You must have read this pretty thoroughly.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:30.180
Showing Her Nape

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.180
Handkerchief
Sticking Out

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:32.950
Toast Ready
in Bag

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.520
I-In any case,

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:37.840
I'll mix this into the materials
for tomorrow's meeting,

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:41.120
and appear during the
uproar after they read it.

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:43.290
Maki won't be able to ignore me after—

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.360
Hey, listen.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:50.040
Isn't it a good thing that they don't
think you're involved in the harassment?

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.970
It means they don't think you
would do anything that low, right?

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:57.980
Though, I do get the feeling
they just forgot about you,

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:00.050
but try to be positive about this.

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:02.770
Any positivity I had just wilted after that.

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:05.980
I feel like that plan really is a low blow.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:07.350
Are you sure about this?

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:10.070
Of course I am!

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.780
I'm going to make copies to mix in.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.340
There she is!

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:17.870
Miser!

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.750
Would you mind not calling me that?

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.200
Not that I'll deny it.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.120
So, what do you need?

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:28.330
Mizushima-senpai.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:31.240
Did they find out that we sneaked
into the student council room?

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:33.680
I don't think we left any evidence.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.220
Would you be the treasurer again?

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:42.200
Really?

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:44.850
Are you sure you want a
miser for your treasurer?

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:46.320
This miser?

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:48.770
S-Sorry about that.

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:50.730
So, why?

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:53.650
Maki collapsed.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:57.860
She said you work quickly.

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:01.580
Please... Please help Maki.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.420
Damn it! Yeah, I know I'm useless!

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:08.420
And it's all my fault, too!

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:10.270
You don't have to get mad.

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:11.590
Shut up! I'm just a tsundere!

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:12.900
Where's the "dere"?

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:13.960
Who knows?!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:14.980
Sure.

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:16.300
I'll be treasurer again.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.080
What? Really?

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:20.320
On one condition, though.

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:21.970
Wh-What's that?

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:26.350
Will you make Eno the president again?

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:27.740
What?

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:30.350
You want Eno to be the president?

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.320
That's right.

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:33.530
Who's Eno, anyway?

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:37.460
I have to explain that, too?

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:40.600
You must mean the former student
council president, Enomoto-senpai.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:41.700
That's right.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:42.560
What?!

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:44.530
You're working with the former president?

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:46.900
Yeah, we're old friends.

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:49.710
I thought you just wanted
to be the treasurer again!

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:51.170
There's that, too,

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.330
but this all started because
Eno wanted to be the president.

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:54.310
What the hell?!

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:56.370
Don't keep spitting new information at me!

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:59.440
I'm confused enough with Maki collapsing!

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:01.260
Um, sorry.

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:04.530
Why did Maki say she had no
idea who was behind this?

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:07.720
The former president is suspicious
enough if she's friends with this girl!

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:10.190
Well? Will you accept my terms?

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:15.020
I want you to help President Maki.

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:18.320
If Maki's not going to be the
president, I don't need you.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:21.610
I work hard every day!!

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:21.610
There's nothing to negotiate.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:22.660
You noticed?

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:24.200
You're surprisingly sharp.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.910
This girl really pisses me off.

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:30.340
But it doesn't make sense
that Maki's the president—

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:32.790
The former president abandoned her job.

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:36.210
You're saying Maki bears no responsibility
for stealing all of Eno's work?

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.220
Maki does everything herself.

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:44.100
I'll admit she's talented, but
she doesn't trust people enough.

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:46.050
Eno is different.

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:49.960
Well, she's missing the most important
traits, she's childish and selfish,

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:51.890
she sometimes throws tantrums,

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:54.900
she takes her anger out on others and
jumps to conclusions, she's a crybaby...

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.940
You're naming more faults than strengths.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:01.510
Is someone talking about me?

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:05.470
It looks just like a normal document.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:09.000
The only names used are
"President" and "Aide,"

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:11.080
so nobody would notice
the difference at a glance.

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.730
It might be a low blow, like Sayo said.

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:16.760
It's kind of like showing
everyone someone's diary.

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.670
"Subject: Dropping Handkerchiefs"?

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:22.840
I-It's for tomorrow's meeting!

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:23.880
Dropping handkerchiefs?

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:24.800
That's right!

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:26.570
It'll be a heated discussion!

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:28.010
I-I see.

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:30.550
This is an additional document for that meeting.

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:31.990
Could you make copies for me?

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:33.580
Okay.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.100
Put them on that shelf when you're done.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.690
I'll come get them later.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.650
There, finally done.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.650
Now I just need to mix them in.

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.790
Sayo's not here yet.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:59.340
Oh, fine, Sayo. I'll go get you.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:02.130
You're right, she may have
more faults than strengths.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:05.880
But Eno gets mad at me
when I cross the line,

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:08.220
yet still trusts me enough
to let me do it again.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.430
What's going on here?

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:13.560
I think Eno makes a better
president than Maki.

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:17.770
S-Sayo...

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:21.180
All the faults she has are
a bit of a problem, though.

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:23.670
Why couldn't you just end it
with the compliment?!

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:24.360
Who's she?

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:26.820
That's Eno.

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:28.510
Hello.

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:29.270
Hello.

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:31.000
I'm not sure what's going on,

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:33.380
but you said I would make
a better president, right?

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:36.620
Didn't you abandon the job for
the sake of your own pride?

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.110
Maki's got her own faults,

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:41.250
but she'd never irresponsibly
flake out on a job!

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:46.100
I don't think you're suited
to being the president.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:49.130
W-K, you're amazing! You're a real man!

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:50.390
Huh? My <i>waki</i> (armpit)?

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.880
I feel the same way!

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:55.020
Do her armpits sweat a lot?

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.750
Maki makes a good president?

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:01.820
I know that better than anyone!

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.240
I was going to make a little trouble for her

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:05.440
so she'd ask for my help,

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:08.150
and then become her aide
because she left me no choice...

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:10.120
But you became her aide instead!

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.130
What?!

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:12.650
It's my fault?

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:19.710
Basically, you wanted Maki to ask
you for help, but she ignored you.

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:23.200
On top of that, I became her
aide, and now you're mad.

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.840
See? Childish, right?

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:25.760
Sayo!

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:28.170
Quit being the president's aide!

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:30.550
If you quit, I'll stop harassing you!

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:31.840
No way.

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:33.740
What are you, a child?

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:35.770
Takes one to know one.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:39.810
Stupid! Stupid!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.260
Birdbrain!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.820
Negotiations have broken down.

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:48.340
Suzu, let's make sure Maki doesn't
push herself too hard again.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:51.020
I'll do some work too,
so show me what to do.

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:53.060
Yes, Kurahashi-senpai.

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:54.090
I'm so happy!

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:56.520
That's the first time you've called me "Suzu."

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.680
You can call me whatever you want, then.

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:00.290
Okay, W-K-senpai.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.160
Why?

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:04.100
You really are selfish.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:05.820
First you say you want to be the president,

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:07.070
then you tell her to quit being the aide.

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:08.090
Oh, shut up.

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:11.720
I like it when I can laugh at your stupidity,

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:14.680
but I don't want to see you do
something so stupid, I can't laugh.

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.310
What are you talking about?

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.680
You're so selfish.

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.480
Not as selfish as you.

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:23.480
I'm not going to play stupid tricks anymore.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:27.730
I'll openly announce my desire to be
the president at tomorrow's meeting.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:30.340
If I don't get any support,
I'll graciously accept defeat.

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:32.700
You don't care anymore if Maki
doesn't acknowledge you?

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:35.030
I don't care.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:38.290
I think Eno makes a better
president than Maki.

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:41.250
I heard something that makes me happier.

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:44.080
If that doesn't work,
I'll try for vice president next.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.490
You call that gracious in defeat?

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.860
So, we didn't manage to get any more help.

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:51.170
But we'll do what we can.

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:53.300
You don't have to...

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:56.770
Besides, Riko, you joined on the
condition you wouldn't do any work.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.180
Shut up.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:00.520
You should learn to rely on others more.

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:02.600
Okay.

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:03.960
In that case,

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:06.220
if you could each come up with ten
suggestions for our love research...

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:08.440
Try not to rely on us <i>that</i> much.

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:10.880
I'm so glad, though.

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:14.160
I thought you would stop coming
if the harassment continued.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:18.200
I've never had so much fun
with another person before.

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.160
It was so fun.

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:22.540
I didn't want to lose that.

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:24.870
I've always done everything alone.

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:25.980
Right.

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:29.040
It's not that she doesn't trust people,

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:31.090
she just doesn't know how to ask for help.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:34.000
It really is a bad thing to be too talented.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.430
Then there's your personality.

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:36.780
Oh, right.

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:39.590
Why didn't you tell me
about the former president?

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:41.620
She was obviously suspicious.

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:45.100
You knew she and Mizushima-senpai
were good friends, right?

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.810
Because she...

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:49.820
Why don't you be the president, then?!

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:54.300
But no one will follow your lead
if you do things your way.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:56.880
You'll come crying to me eventually.

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:59.730
No one's said anything
like that to me before.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:03.080
If Enomoto-senpai was
involved in harassing me,

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:06.670
it would mean she still didn't
accept me, and I didn't want that.

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:09.420
Tell her that next time.

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:10.750
What?

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:12.600
They're perfect rivals for each other.

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:13.920
This is stupid.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:18.820
Doesn't look like it'll rain today.

00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:19.930
Well, then...

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:21.220
Whoops.

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:24.870
I hope I didn't mix them up...

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:27.600
Must be materials for tomorrow's meeting.

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:29.330
Well, I'm sure it'll be fine.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.270
I need to get rid of these
before anyone sees them.

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:43.920
Enomoto-san, those documents...

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:47.060
I-I checked them and found a mistake,

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:47.990
so I'll destroy these!

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:51.540
The copies you asked for are on the shelf!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.150
Don't worry about picking those up!

00:17:56.150 --> 00:18:00.720
Enomoto-san works so hard, but
she needs to learn to calm down.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.470
The Next Day

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:05.240
The student meeting will now begin.

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:07.600
Please take a look at the
documents in front of you.

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:12.890
The activities of every student
organization, their goals and tasks,

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:15.350
and opinions collected from
suggestion boxes around school

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:18.450
have been summarized with
comments from the student council.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:20.580
If you have any questions or opinions...

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:23.580
Objection!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.040
Enomoto-senpai?

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.620
If you're not part of this
council, then please leave.

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:30.250
I <i>am</i> part of this!

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:35.610
I'm still officially the president,
and you're my aide and vice president.

00:18:35.610 --> 00:18:37.480
I'm here today because—

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:38.520
Excuse me...

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.340
What is the "Love Lab"?

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:42.280
What?

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:44.930
Subject 5
On the Topic of Dropping Handkerchiefs

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:49.270
Maki-san, is this what you've been doing?

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:56.840
Did they do this?

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:59.070
How could they do something so cruel?

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.090
You're wrong!

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:03.620
The "president" referred
to in this document is her!

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:04.620
What?

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:07.070
You said it yourself!

00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:09.790
You're still the president,
and Maki is your aide!

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:14.210
They're conducting a love
lab in the student council?

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:15.960
What is this?

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:18.170
But romantic relationships are forbidden.

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:20.810
Hey...

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:24.130
Is this what they've been
studying so seriously?

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:25.890
The text seems serious enough.

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:30.060
Yes, but it does seem like
something Enomoto-san would do.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:32.690
She does seem rather opinionated.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.990
She seems like she would
be difficult to work under.

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:37.870
Was she really doing this?

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.030
No way.

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:43.380
Poor Maki-san had to go along with it.

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:44.740
What a disaster.

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:46.140
Maki.

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:49.030
This is kind of embarrassing.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:50.520
How disillusioning.

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.750
Shut up!

00:19:57.970 --> 00:20:01.180
How dare you laugh at someone
who's been working so hard for you?

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:06.180
Besides, who hasn't fantasized
about having a cool boyfriend,

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.510
or wanted to be thought of as cute?

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:09.430
I haven't.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.140
Whose side are you on?!

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:15.160
It's embarrassing to admit, but I have.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:17.760
It's normal, isn't it?

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:21.150
Whether you're part of a student
organization, or a good student,

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:24.880
we're all the same in that respect... so...

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:27.630
That's why you've been
investigating this, right?

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:31.300
At the request of an anonymous student.

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:32.070
What?

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:35.290
There was a note asking
you to investigate it.

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:36.490
Suggestions

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:36.500
In this box.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:39.900
Th-That's right.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:42.050
We've been investigating it for that girl.

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:44.100
Oh, I see.

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:45.130
How nice.

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.590
They're both so thoughtful.

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:49.220
And I said such mean things...

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:50.180
Me, too.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.660
Thanks for that.

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:53.630
You could've spoken up sooner, though.

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:55.620
Well, I just now came up with it.

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:57.060
Liar.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.850
Sorry for coming so unprepared.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:02.780
We'll hold this meeting another day,
so you're dismissed for today.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:06.500
Also, in consideration of the
feelings of the anonymous student,

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:08.280
don't tell anyone about today.

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:09.220
Please!

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:09.990
Yes.

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:15.290
I'm glad that worked out.

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:19.670
Come on, I know you're shocked, but...

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:22.840
Riko, thank you.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.630
I didn't do anything.

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:30.140
I'm so happy you scolded
me the way you did.

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:37.230
I'm so glad you saw me then.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:42.430
I hope you'll continue to be my friend!

00:21:42.430 --> 00:21:44.330
Of course I will, stupid!

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:46.410
This is wonderful!

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:47.700
Oh, come on.

00:21:47.980 --> 00:21:49.660
I'm really sorry.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.320
It's all right.

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:53.750
I'm sorry for pushing the blame on you, too.

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:57.610
In order to make up for it, I'll
work for you as the vice president.

00:21:57.610 --> 00:21:59.330
Then I'll be your treasurer.

00:21:59.530 --> 00:22:01.020
What the hell?!

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:04.440
Now we can all study romance together.

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:06.670
It'll be so lively.

00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:08.870
I didn't say I'd do that!

00:22:08.870 --> 00:22:10.200
You seemed pretty excited.

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:11.060
Seriously?

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:12.070
Really?

00:22:12.070 --> 00:22:14.950
Wh-What are you saying? Are you stupid?

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:27.110
Suggestions

00:23:58.480 --> 00:24:01.720
I'm Enomoto Yuiko, Fuji Girls'
Student Council Vice President.

00:24:01.720 --> 00:24:04.460
I returned to the student council because
I worry about my underclassmen.

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:06.460
I'm Treasurer Mizushima Sayori.

00:24:06.460 --> 00:24:08.990
I returned to the student council
because I worry about the budget.

00:24:08.990 --> 00:24:12.630
W-Well, we won't have anything to worry
about with you in charge of our money.

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:13.300
Leave it to me.

00:24:13.300 --> 00:24:16.800
I'm keeping a close watch on the student
council's budget and your allowance.

00:24:16.800 --> 00:24:18.540
Wait, why my allowance?

00:24:18.540 --> 00:24:20.670
Your parents said you've been
wasting a lot of money,

00:24:20.670 --> 00:24:22.060
and asked me to do it.

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:24.520
Have some more faith in your daughter!

00:24:24.010 --> 00:24:27.180
Love Lab Resumes! Or So We Thought...

00:24:27.210 --> 00:24:30.180
Don't miss the next episode!
